# The table editor, a refusal and the advanced mode (tests/t1/pinball3d_editor.sh), window 1440x900.
# A speed outside the limits of the format is refused with the loader's message, and the field shows the table's value again.
4 move 521 743
5 down
6 up
8 key f meta
9 text speed
10 key Tab
11 text 20000
12 key Enter
15 key Escape
# The surface "rubber" is reached by its path in the file (Cmd+G); Cmd+J shows it as the file has it and puts the caret there; the
# text is replaced, and a click on the table leaves the field.
17 key g meta
18 text surfaces[2]
19 key Enter
22 key j meta
24 key a meta
25 text {"id":"rubber","friction":0.7,"restitution":0.8}
28 move 300 500
29 down
30 up
32 key s meta
